          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>The standard error is $\\dfrac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt{n}} = \\dfrac{0.025}{\\sqrt{25}} = \\dfrac{0.025}{5} = 0.005$. Then $z = \\dfrac{42.035 - 42.05}{0.005} = \\dfrac{-0.015}{0.005} = -3$, and $P(Z < -3) = 0.00135$. The distractor 0.2743 is what you get if you forget to divide by $\\sqrt{n}$: $z = -0.015/0.025 = -0.6$ gives $P \\approx 0.2743$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Sai số chuẩn là $\\dfrac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt{n}} = \\dfrac{0{,}025}{\\sqrt{25}} = \\dfrac{0{,}025}{5} = 0{,}005$. Khi đó $z = \\dfrac{42{,}035 - 42{,}05}{0{,}005} = \\dfrac{-0{,}015}{0{,}005} = -3$, và $P(Z < -3) = 0{,}00135$. Đáp án nhiễu 0.2743 chính là kết quả khi quên chia cho $\\sqrt{n}$: $z = -0{,}015/0{,}025 = -0{,}6$ cho $P \\approx 0{,}2743$.</p></div>"
